       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Here are the update notes for Version 1.3",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed the access issues for the nodes \"Photo Blackmail\" in Chapter 3 and \"Bribery Failed\" in Chapter 4.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the UI display issue that occurred after skipping the plot during the fishing boat exploration in Chapter 5.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Corrected errors in some subtitles.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Feel free to keep sending us your feedback, and check the progress of bug fixes here:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "\\[Tencent Docs] Sin Gold Game Steam Official Version Bug Feedback Form",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
